      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Nearly a decade before Nebraska became a state, the federal government established an Omaha reservation in what is now Thurston County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://thurstoncountyne.gov/about-our-county/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The arrival of railroads in the early 1900s spurred the growth of additional communities throughout Thurston County.",
